  "description": "Single storey front extension incorporating porch; single and two storey side extension; two storey rear extension; alterations and extension to roof; rear dormer; rooflights in front and both side roof slopes; external alterations (part demolition of attached garage)",
  "epc_number": "9235-3957-0202-9335-5204",
