  "street_name": "ANSELM ROAD",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposed extension to the roof would result in an unbalanced, discordant and unsympathtic roof form that would&amp;nbsp; form an incongruous and contrived addition to the host dwelling,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;failing to respect the character and proportions of the dwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the locality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposal would thereby be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of The London Plan (2021), GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan Policy (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
